 "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资"], "excerpt": "美国经济数据强劲叠加五年期美债拍卖需求疲软，引发全球债券抛售、美债收益率飙升，市场重新定价美联储加息路径，风险资产承压。\n\n\n周四，美股期指走低，纳指期货日内跌幅扩大至0.6%，标普500指数期货跌0.4%。欧股低开，MSCI亚太指数跌0.6%。布伦特原油收复早盘跌幅，涨0.2%至98.33美元/桶。黄金小幅下跌0.2", "published_at": "2026-09-24T07:49:45Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-2b821e169ae3.json", "engagement": 180, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-2f4d8292a016", "title": "OpenAI CEO : AI 可能带来工业革命式动荡；Anthropic 宣布成立生命科学团队和实验室；腾讯 QClaw 宣布将停运", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370917", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/58/7c/587cccae5161b95636d74592cfc81099.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "已证实首例：澳大利亚政府网站遭 OpenAI 智能体入侵\n\n\n9 月 23 日，据路透社报道，澳大利亚总理安东尼 · 阿尔巴尼斯（Anthony Albanese）表示，OpenAI 开发的一款 AI 智能体在 6 月未经授权侵入了澳大利亚政府网站，访问了公共和非公共文件。这是已知的首例 AI", "published_at": "2026-09-24T01:13:32Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-2f4d8292a016.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-3641f7c5792e", "title": "刚刚，苹果「液态玻璃」缔造者，给 Muse 造了个 AI 拓麻歌子", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "莫崇宇", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1681928?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/lark2pad-1790214802058-1.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "在过去几年里，我们看够了 AI 硬件的笑话。\n\n\n那些号称要「干掉智能手机」的 AI 硬件，无论别在胸前还是揣在兜里，最终大多沦为昂贵的硬件垃圾。正当人们以为 AI 最适合留在手机 App 和智能眼镜里时，马克·扎克伯格却在刚刚结束的 Meta Connect", "published_at": "2026-09-24T01:59:48Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-3641f7c5792e.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-3fc93d804a3e", "title": "黄仁勋：AI“末日论”太过火，安全问题可以靠工程解决", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782470", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d70fe1d3-672f-44df-9e01-f6974aff6788.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "当AI圈的\"末日论者\"越喊越响，全球最大芯片公司的掌舵人却亮出了一张截然不同的底牌——安全是工程问题，不是监管豁免的借口。\n\n\n9月23日，The Ezra Klein Show播客发布了由《纽约时报》专栏作家Ezra", "published_at": "2026-09-24T10:40:24Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-3fc93d804a3e.json", "engagement": 200, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-5127a802e69e", "title": "AI 想包办你的一切，高通想包办你的 AI", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "肖钦鹏", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1681946?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6ab4a7288dc87.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n手机里的 AI 已经能写总结、修照片、陪你聊天，可当你想真正把一件事交给它——安排一次出差、跟进一个项目、订下一场聚会——它常常又把问题原样还给你：我好像不明白。\n\n\n2026 年，AI", "published_at": "2026-09-24T05:35:32Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5127a802e69e.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-682f6f440d56", "title": "半夏投资李蓓：AI资本开支或在明年年中见顶，地产的机会升级到二十年一遇", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "腾讯财经", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782474", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/1c267bd8-13cd-4394-9c23-a333b44470e0.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资"], "excerpt": "“地产的机会，我以前说是十年一遇，现在变成二十年一遇。”\n\n\n近日，半夏投资创始人李蓓在与腾讯财经对话时表示，地产现房新政对地产股价造成了较大短期负面冲击，但地产机会的级别其实是提高了，后续地产股牛市持续的时间会被拉长，高度也可以看得更高。在她看来，在地产新规的影响下：未来1-2年，行业将得到更彻底的出清，更多企业继续", "published_at": "2026-09-24T11:47:27Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-682f6f440d56.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-6bb158d3ab40", "title": "8点1氪丨苹果出手限制“摇一摇”广告；王慧文称想组局买下西贝：喜欢这个品牌；Meta测试真人代Muse拨打电话，引发内部隐私争议", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3996646362747015?f=rss", "image_url": null, "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "科技"], "excerpt": "今日热点导览\n\n\n微软、亚马逊、Adobe等集体降价挽留企业客户\n\n\n消息称豆包开始收缩对话团队\n\n\n闲鱼：“涉未成年人淫秽”系不实消息\n\n\n未来四年“双一流”高校本科招生数还将扩容7.6万人\n\n\n王兴兴再登《财富》40岁以下商界精英榜，张雪、姚顺雨等首次入选\n\n\nTOP3大新闻\n\n\n苹果出手限制“摇一摇”广告\n\n\n据", "published_at": "2026-09-24T12:10:33Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-6bb158d3ab40.json", "engagement": 180, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-732f4b80a62c", "title": "Trump and Xi come face-to-face as US and China battle to win the AI race", "source": "BBC", "author": "", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6gqdgg8w59xo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image_url": "https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/eb15/live/c9e0fd20-b7cd-11f1-9f14-6be29ed37cd7.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "News", "topic": "news", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["BBC", "News", "en", "news", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "\"Whoever wins AI, WINS!\"\n\nUS President Donald Trump has been blunt about his AI ambitions, as well as about who he considers the US's main rival to be:", "published_at": "2026-09-23T22:01:17Z", "curated_at": "2026-