erative-ai-telling-it-to-go-off-and-design-a-game-from-your-frown", "image_url": "https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/helldivers-2-major-order-citizen-nightmares-arg-cape-01.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Rock Paper Shotgun", "en", "gaming", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "A new patent from Microsoft shows how they want to record your facial expressions, show them to an AI, and have it redesign the game you're playing. It's not", "published_at": "2026-09-23T12:17:21Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-a72c310c628e.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-b088eae14457", "title": "家庭饮品 DIY 指南（五）：特调咖啡及其他饮品", "source": "少数派", "author": "老林还年少", "url": "https://sspai.com/prime/story/home-made-beverages-5", "image_url": "https://rssfile.sspai.com/2026/09/18/7ee84e5ca3d4b57096b606ac87bcf9b6.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/ignore-error/1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "少数派", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "往期文章：（一）工欲善其事，必先利其器（二）常用液体物料推荐（三）常用固体物料推荐（四）奶昔、柠檬和茶系列配方这一篇的配方主要是特调咖啡和其他类饮品，特调咖啡中的咖啡液按照固定比例萃取Espresso", "published_at": "2026-09-24T08:20:39Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-b088eae14457.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-b39fd81b2720", "title": "14.99 万元起，全新旅行者 7 开启预售，插混燃油两手抓", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "陈世琛", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1682158?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Traveller7-cover-16x9.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "co